{"name":"Airforce","hex":"#364d70","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"airforce","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Alternative spelling of air force."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/airforce"}],"entries":[{"title":"Airforce (TV series)","blocks":[{"text":"Airforce (空军) is a Singapore Chinese miniseries produced by the SBC in 1988. It was the first military themed drama produced in Singapore and produced in collaboration with the Ministry of Defence. The drama featured the Republic of Singapore Air Force (RSSAF) and its aircraft such as the Northrop F-5, Aermacchi S-211 and Aermacchi SF.260. Most scenes were filmed on-site at Changi Airport and its adjoining air base. The series creator was Jiang Long, who also co-created the 1984 classic period drama The Awakening. The miniseries was later dubbed in English for broadcast on SBC 5 in April 1989 as a strategy by SBC to air the English dubbed version of a Mandarin serial first before the actual serial was shown. The dub had received positive viewer response."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Airforce_(TV_series)"},{"title":"Airforce (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Airforce is a British heavy metal band formed in London, England in 1986. The band were active until 2001, before reforming in 2008, and releasing their first studio album Judgement Day in 2016."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Airforce_(band)"},{"title":"Air force","blocks":[{"text":"An air force in the broadest sense is the national military branch that primarily conducts aerial warfare. More specifically, it is the branch of a nation's armed services that is responsible for aerial warfare as distinct from an army aviation or naval aviation units. Typically, air forces are responsible for gaining control of the air, carrying out strategic and tactical bombing missions, and providing support to land and naval forces often in the form of aerial reconnaissance and close air support."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/Usaf.f15.f16.kc135.750pix.jpg/330px-Usaf.f15.f16.kc135.750pix.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Air_force"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/Tupolev_Tu-22M3_at_Ryazan_Dyagilevo.jpg/500px-Tupolev_Tu-22M3_at_Ryazan_Dyagilevo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/Tupolev_Tu-22M3_at_Ryazan_Dyagilevo.jpg/1280px-Tupolev_Tu-22M3_at_Ryazan_Dyagilevo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/Tupolev_Tu-22M3_at_Ryazan_Dyagilevo.jpg/500px-Tupolev_Tu-22M3_at_Ryazan_Dyagilevo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATupolev_Tu-22M3_at_Ryazan_Dyagilevo.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/85/PLAAF_Changhe_WZ-10_-_Jordan.jpg/500px-PLAAF_Changhe_WZ-10_-_Jordan.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/85/PLAAF_Changhe_WZ-10_-_Jordan.jpg/500px-PLAAF_Changhe_WZ-10_-_Jordan.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APLAAF_Changhe_WZ-10_-_Jordan.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8e/TAI_Anka.jpg/500px-TAI_Anka.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8e/TAI_Anka.jpg/1280px-TAI_Anka.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8e/TAI_Anka.jpg/500px-TAI_Anka.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parse